question: <one sentence: what do we not know?>
decision_this_informs: <what changes depending on the answer>
setting: <dataset, geometry, code, and pinned commits>
hypothesis: <what we expect, stated so it can be wrong>
metric: <exact definition, script path, commit>
partner_metric: <a metric that punishes doing less: smoothing, averaging, predicting the prior>
baseline: <run id or configuration of the control>
baseline_tolerance: <number>
kill_criteria: <stop if ...>
negative_result_means: <what we conclude and write down>
out_of_scope: <what this run will not try>
